t","value":"可得：Q=450J （1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--jiaxing-moni-2504-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--jiaxing-moni-2504","source_question_id":"jiaxing-moni-2504-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6312458f5671d092f5135aef24d6a15d1a382b066a96952c7c98d0616fdad7a6","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （11分）某游戏装置如图所示，由弹射装置、圆心为 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的两个 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 圆弧构成的竖直轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"ABC"},{"type":"text","value":" 、水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 和逆时针转动的倾斜传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"DE"},{"type":"text","value":" 平滑连接而成。水平接收平台 "},{"type":"math","value":"FJ"},{"type":"text","value":" 的位置可自由调节，其上方静置 "},{"type":"math","value":"n"},{"type":"text","value":" 个相同的小球。现弹射装置将质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.2\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑块（视为质点）以初动能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{k}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 水平射入 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，通过轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"ABCD"},{"type":"text","value":" 和传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"DE"},{"type":"text","value":" 后，恰好沿水平进入接收平台并与其上的小球发生碰撞，则游戏成功。已知轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"ABC"},{"type":"text","value":" 中 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1} = 0.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2} = 0.15\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"DE"},{"type":"text","value":" 的长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 0.8\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、倾斜角度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、运行速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v = 1\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，接收平台上的小球质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 0.1\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，滑块与传送带之间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其余各段光滑，不计空气阻力。取 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n(1) 若滑块恰好不脱离圆弧轨道 ABC，求滑块通过 C 点时的速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" 及轨道对滑块的支持力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(2) 某次调试中, 当接收平台左端与 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 点的水平距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 0.432 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时, 游戏恰好成功, 求滑块在本次运行过程中与传送带之间因摩擦产生的热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3) 若所有碰撞均为弹性正碰，则在游戏成功的条件下，接收平台上第 "},{"type":"math","value":"n"},{"type":"text","value":" 个小球获得的动量 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_n"},{"type":"text","value":" 与滑块的初动能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{k}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间的关系。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bfa35743c3941a62626f8cf0d0f8c27680fd2837ff98145e456d9ea9d79c52e7.png","width":1236,"height":342,"width_mm":145.253,"row_group":"jiaxing-moni-2504-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数：重力加速度g均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（1）根据临界条件："},{"type":"math","value":"mg=m\\frac{v_{A}^{2}}{R_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{A}=\\sqrt{2}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据机械能守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} mv_A^2 +mg(R_1 + R_2) = \\frac{1}{2} mv_C^2"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C} = 3\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据圆周运动最低点受力："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}-mg=m\\frac{v_{C}^{2}}{R_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=14N"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）根据运动合成与分解："},{"type":"math","value":"x=v_{E}\\cos\\theta\\cdot\\frac{v_{E}\\sin\\theta}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E}=3m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据牛顿第二定律："},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin\\theta+\\mu mg\\cos\\theta=ma"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"a=10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据匀变速直线运动规律："},{"type":"math","value":"L=v_{E}t+\\frac{1}{2}at^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得：t=0.2s （1分）\n根据摩擦生热规律："},{"type":"math","value":"Q=\\mu mg\\cos\\theta\\cdot(L+vt)"},{"type":"text","value":"可得：Q=0.8J （1分）\n（3）根据动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} mv_{E}^{2} - E_{\\mathrm{k}} = -mg(L\\sin \\theta -R_{1} - R_{2}) - \\mu mgL\\cos \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E}=\\sqrt{10E_{k}-9}"},{"type":"text","value":"滑块与小球1碰撞，\n根据弹性碰撞规律："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{E}\\cos\\theta=mv_{m}+Mv_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} m \\left(v _ {E} \\cos \\theta\\right) ^ {2} = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {m} ^ {2} + \\frac {1}{2} M v _ {1} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\frac{16}{15}v_{E}"},{"type":"text","value":"随后小球 1 与小球 2 碰撞，由于质量相等，速度交换，以此类推……\n因此，小球"},{"type":"math","value":"n"},{"type":"text","value":"的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{n} = v_{1} = \\frac{16}{15}v_{E}"},{"type":"text","value":"由此可得："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{n}=\\frac{8}{75}\\sqrt{10E_{k}-9}\\quad(E_{k}\\geq0.9J)"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--jiaxing-moni-2504-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--jiaxing-moni-2504","source_question_id":"jiaxing-moni-2504-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"45f39f6c03c371daa230ec67c6eae9149e8994cb2bf6f0ba429b201a64ff67a4","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12 分) 如图所示是研究电磁感应的装置, 由 I 和 II 两部分组成。装置 I 由两个半径分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_1"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_2"},{"type":"text","value":" 、圆心分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_1"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_2"},{"type":"text","value":" 的水平金属圆环与金属棒固定连接而成。装置 I 处于磁感应强度大小为 "}