"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n②此过程中, 弹簧弹力对线圈的冲量大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6a92e0250b084e6a712d4d1f34d9cb9aadceee6a244e6701c1dde87ec1b95e82.png","width":1283,"height":468,"width_mm":150.71,"row_group":"jiaxing-moni-2504-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（1）上极板"},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"带正电 （1分）根据装置结构，导体棒有效切割长度："},{"type":"math","value":"l = r_{2} - r_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）根据动生电动势表达式可得："},{"type":"math","value":"U = \\frac{1}{2} B\\omega (r_2^2 -r_1^2)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）根据动量定理："},{"type":"math","value":"nBl\\Delta q=mv-0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）可得：放电电量"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta q=\\frac{mv}{nBl}"},{"type":"text","value":"电容器充电完成后：总电量"},{"type":"math","value":"q_{\\text{总}}=CU"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）可得："},{"type":"math","value":"q_{\\text{总}}=\\frac{1}{2}CB\\omega(r_{2}^{2}-r_{1}^{2})"},{"type":"text","value":"根据电荷守恒：剩余电量"},{"type":"math","value":"q=q_{\\text{总}}-\\Delta q"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\frac{1}{2}CB\\omega(r_{2}^{2}-r_{1}^{2})-\\frac{mv}{nBl}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3) ①根据能量守恒:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}=Q+2\\times\\frac{1}{2}kx^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分) 可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\sqrt{\\frac{mv^{2}-2Q}{2k}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n②根据动量定理:"},{"type":"math","value":"-nBl\\cdot\\frac{nBlx}{R}+I=0-(-mv)"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{n^{2}B^{2}l^{2}}{R}\\sqrt{\\frac{mv^{2}-2Q}{2k}}+mv"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--jiaxing-moni-2504-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--jiaxing-moni-2504","source_question_id":"jiaxing-moni-2504-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"56f678e6a0bb260a82399b10fd030754cc466b504fae59065cfe69f5d43b97a1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （13分）如图所示是粒子发射接收装置，粒子源 O（大小不计）能均匀释放初速可视为 0 的电子，单位时间内释放的电子数为 n。在以 O 为圆心、半径为 R 的水平区域内存在辐向电场，能为电子提供可在 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{eB^{2}R^{2}}{6m}\\sim\\frac{eB^{2}R^{2}}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 范围内调节的加速电压 U。电子经辐向电场加速后沿各个径向均匀射出，后进入同时存在磁感应强度为 B 的匀强磁场和电场强度为 E 的匀强电场的区域，两场方向均竖直向上。O' 为粒子源 O 正下方的一点，且位于足够大的水平收集板上，O' 与 O 的距离 h 可调。已知电子电量为 e，质量为 m，电子到达收集板后立刻被吸收且电中和，不计电子受到的重力及相互间作用力。\n（1）求电子刚从辐向电场射出时速度 v 的大小范围；\n(2) 上下移动收集板, 求收集板上能收集到电子的区域的最大面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3) 若无论怎样调节辐向电场的加速电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" , 电子在收集板上的落点与收集板中心 "},{"type":"math","value":"O'"},{"type":"text","value":" 的距离都相同, 求\n①距离 h 需满足的条件；\n②收集板所受冲击力大小 F。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0f2c0ebf4ffb7ede0d83b3b0420f9ff84c495d1f245bafeeea33794e2122af71.png","width":605,"height":491,"width_mm":70.947,"row_group":"jiaxing-moni-2504-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（1）根据动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"eU=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}-0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\min}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}eBR}{3m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\max}=\\frac{eBR}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n速度范围："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}eBR}{3m}\\leq v\\leq\\frac{eBR}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2) 根据洛伦兹力提供向心力:"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB = m\\frac{v^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n可得: 电子运动最大半径:"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{\\max} = R"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n电子与中心"},{"type":"math","value":"O'"},{"type":"text","value":"的最远距离:"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{\\max} = (\\sqrt{2} + 1)R"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n电子与中心"},{"type":"math","value":"O'"},{"type":"text","value":"的最近距离:"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{\\min} = (\\sqrt{2} - 1)R"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n收集板上能收集到电子的区域面积"},{"type":"math","value":"S = 4\\sqrt{2}\\pi R^2"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/40e3eb5e495a1e52cb7faf7d44c86a847f7470e5d0a42172b22fbc3c8ce5b775.png","width":432,"height":429,"width_mm":54.7},{"type":"text","value":"（3）由题意可知，接收板只能在电子运动周期整数倍的位置，才能使所有落在收集板上电子与收集板中心距离都相同。\n电子运动周期："},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{2\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据匀变速直线运动规律："},{"type":"math","value":"h=\\frac{Ee}{2m}t^{2}=\\frac{2mE\\pi^{2}k^{2}}{eB^{2}}\\quad(k=0,1,2,\\cdots)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\perp}=\\frac{Ee}{m}t=\\frac{2\\pi Ek}{B}\\quad(k=0,1,2,\\cdots)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据动量定理："},{"type":"math","value":"-F\\Delta t=0-Nmv_{\\perp}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n可得："},{"type":"math","value":"F=\\frac{2\\pi nmEk}{B}\\quad(k=0,1,2,\\cdots\\cdots)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}}]}
